"Flexible Timers is operated by Xintech LLC. Flexible Timers may send SMS\n      messages only to a phone number that a signed-in user adds, verifies, and\n      opts into as their own account phone number. The current SMS program is\n      limited to account phone verification codes and user-created timer/reminder\n      SMS that the user schedules for themselves. Flexible Timers does not send\n      marketing text messages and does not allow users to send SMS to arbitrary\n      third-party recipients. Flexible Timers SMS is not a two-way chat or\n      conversation service; inbound keywords are used only for STOP, HELP, START,\n      and YES compliance handling." = "Flexible Timers upravlja Xintech LLC. Flexible Timers lahko sporočila SMS pošilja samo na telefonsko številko, ki jo prijavljeni uporabnik doda, preveri in zanjo poda soglasje kot za lastno telefonsko številko računa. Trenutni program SMS je omejen na kode za preverjanje telefonske številke računa in SMS-e časovnikov/opomnikov, ki jih uporabnik ustvari in načrtuje zase. Flexible Timers ne pošilja tržnih besedilnih sporočil in uporabnikom ne omogoča pošiljanja SMS-ov poljubnim prejemnikom tretjih oseb. SMS Flexible Timers ni storitev dvosmernega klepeta ali pogovora; dohodne ključne besede se uporabljajo samo za obravnavo skladnosti STOP, HELP, START in YES.";
"Flexible Timers reminder: You scheduled this SMS reminder for 4:00 PM:\n      Pick up child for after-school piano class. Reply STOP to opt out, HELP\n      for help." = "Opomnik Flexible Timers: ta SMS-opomnik ste načrtovali za 16.00:\n      Poberi otroka po pouku klavirja. Za odjavo odgovorite STOP, za pomoč pa HELP.";
